WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.628 --> 00:00:04.067
Start here with Velstrian Buy.

2
00:00:04.708 --> 00:00:09.567
Welcome to Velstrian Buy. Your overview
shows what needs you next,

3
00:00:09.567 --> 00:00:11.572
and your buying steps in order.

4
00:00:11.572 --> 00:00:15.167
Here are the first three things to do.

5
00:00:15.795 --> 00:00:22.112
First, write a requirement. Start from a
template, a document or a blank page,

6
00:00:22.112 --> 00:00:25.567
and set how you will score the replies.

7
00:00:26.195 --> 00:00:31.627
Second, send it to suppliers. Each one
gets a personal link to the pack,

8
00:00:31.627 --> 00:00:35.467
and their replies arrive on the
evaluation.

9
00:00:36.095 --> 00:00:40.381
Third, score the bids. Your panel enters
each score,

10
00:00:40.381 --> 00:00:45.033
and Velstrian Buy ranks them by the
weightings you published.

11
00:00:45.661 --> 00:00:50.633
Need a hand? Open Help and support at any
time.

